hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1309","We were told by Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Dawrqi, Abu Dawud told us, Shu’bah told us, Al-Dawrqi told us, Ibn Ulayya told us, he told us Hisham Al-Dastawa’i, H. Ziyad bin Ayyub, Muhammad, meaning Ibn Yazid Al-Wasiti, narrated to us on the authority of Hisham Al-Dastawa’i, and Shu’bah, H. Salam bin Junada told us, Waki` told us, all on the authority of Hisham, on the authority of Qatada, on the authority of Anas, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, He said: “Spittering in the mosque is a sin, and its expiation is burying it.” And in the report of Ibn Ulayya and Waki’, he said: “Spitting in the mosque.”"
